{"4335990": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Plura Ingenia: Patient 16", "steam_appid": 4335990, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Patient 16</strong> is a first-person psychological horror game where your fears, personality, and choices are being analyzed, shaping the world around you<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4335990/extras/dc7b034a986879717435a2390314250e.poster.avif?t=1786990065\" width=1170 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4335990/extras/dc7b034a986879717435a2390314250e.webm?t=1786990065\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4335990/extras/dc7b034a986879717435a2390314250e.mp4?t=1786990065\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><u><strong>You are being studied</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout the experience, you will answer unsettling questions and make choices that define your psychological profile, shaping how the game unfolds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you impulsive or cautious? <br>Introverted or extroverted?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your answers influence:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The entities you encounter</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The way the world presents itself</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The tone and intensity of the horror</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The paths and events you experience</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Some changes are subtle. Others may completely alter reality itself.</strong> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>See how the facility changes based on your answers.</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4335990/extras/4814f360a176dc0e27e0fb45d14b24ee.poster.avif?t=1786990065\" width=1170 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4335990/extras/4814f360a176dc0e27e0fb45d14b24ee.webm?t=1786990065\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4335990/extras/4814f360a176dc0e27e0fb45d14b24ee.mp4?t=1786990065\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> <strong>You can only choose one. Which door do you enter?</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4335990/extras/3c049b7ea53b7ad9c926409063ac1597.poster.avif?t=1786990065\" width=1170 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4335990/extras/3c049b7ea53b7ad9c926409063ac1597.webm?t=1786990065\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4335990/extras/3c049b7ea53b7ad9c926409063ac1597.mp4?t=1786990065\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Be Honest and Discover who you really are. Answer psychological questions to determine your personality.</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4335990/extras/bcd0000138663dfa88ac0543893c2ea0.poster.avif?t=1786990065\" width=1170 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4335990/extras/bcd0000138663dfa88ac0543893c2ea0.webm?t=1786990065\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4335990/extras/bcd0000138663dfa88ac0543893c2ea0.mp4?t=1786990065\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Explore a mysterious facility and uncover the truth behind a psychological experiment.</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4335990/extras/f80a5ceb9a587767c4d9bd5d571a4c20.poster.avif?t=1786990065\" width=1170 height=444 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4335990/extras/f80a5ceb9a587767c4d9bd5d571a4c20.webm?t=1786990065\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4335990/extras/f80a5ceb9a587767c4d9bd5d571a4c20.mp4?t=1786990065\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Carry, loot, and throw almost anything using realistic physics.</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4335990/extras/eee16ae2357e91fe7202772fca339698.poster.avif?t=1786990065\" width=1170 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4335990/extras/eee16ae2357e91fe7202772fca339698.webm?t=1786990065\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4335990/extras/eee16ae2357e91fe7202772fca339698.mp4?t=1786990065\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Not everyone survived the experiment.</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4335990/extras/1da0f7755497dd6752e0247c83bb6f23.poster.avif?t=1786990065\" width=1170 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4335990/extras/1da0f7755497dd6752e0247c83bb6f23.webm?t=1786990065\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4335990/extras/1da0f7755497dd6752e0247c83bb6f23.mp4?t=1786990065\" ty